@startuml SpiServiceStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init()
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Ready --> Ready : Write()
Ready --> Ready : Transceive()

note right of Ready
  Stateless.
  Each call is an independent
  SPI master driver operation.
end note
@enduml